\itemize{
\item \code{name}: the dimension name
\item \code{full_name}: the full path of the dimension
\item \code{size}: the dimension size (numeric)
\item \code{type}: the dimension type, e.g., \code{"HORIZONTAL_X"}, \code{"HORIZONTAL_Y"},
